From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adam Domurad <adomurad@Adams-MBP.ht.home>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 12:08:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: consume the foundation packages under the
 @aztec-foundation scope

The packages built by the foundation repository (bb.js, bb-avm-sim, cdb, wsdb,
ipc-runtime, the noir-* packages, l1-artifacts, constants-codegen and the
protocol artifacts packages) are published as @aztec-foundation/*. Imports,
manifests, the toolchain pin table and the lockfiles follow; the versioned docs
and the docs TS examples (which install the published packages) keep the @aztec
names until the @aztec-foundation releases exist.

